      "text_original": "## MEGA DSC (TEACHER RECRUITMENT TEST) - 2025\nCALL LETTER FOR CERTIFICATE VERIFICATION\n\n10\n\nIT No.: AIPSC(M)1955I\n\nName: MUDAPALLY KAMALAKAR\n\nName: MUDAPALLY RAMAIAH\nAddress: Hanumantemple, Other State Village, Other State Mandal, Other State-\n505528\n\nContact No: 94158975135\n\nEmail: mudapallykamalakar123@gmail.co\nMudapally Kamalakara\n\nஅன்பு\n\nIt is hereby informed that Sri / Smt. / Kumari MUDAPALLY KAMALAKAR,\nS/o D/o W/o Sri LAXMIRAJAM, appeared for Mega DSC - 2025, is hereby requested\nto attend for Certificate Verification in person as per the schedule given below.\n\nDate of certificate verification: 29-Aug-2025\n\nVenice:\n\ngnt_committee_1, A C COLLEGE GUNTUR\nSAMBASIVA PET MAIN ROAD, GUNTUR 522001\n\n9.00 AM\n\nTime: 9.00 AM\nBefore attending for certificate verification, please upload all relevant\ncertificates/documents at candidate login (apdsc.apcffs.in)\n\nFurther, it is informed that issuance of a call letter for certificate verification\ndoes not confer any right to selection. Attendance at certificate verification is solely for the\npurpose of confirming the particulars furnished in the online application. The final selection\nof candidates will be subject to merit, eligibility, reservation, and other prescribed\nconditions.\n\nIf the candidate fails to attend certificate verification, or fails to produce the\nrequired certificates at the time of verification, or if the certificates are found to be non-\ngenuine or incorrect, such candidates shall forfeit the right of selection, and the next\neligible candidate will be considered for certificate verification.\n\nList of Original Documents to be Produced:\n\n1. Printout of the Online Application of Mega DSC-2025.\n\n2. SSC or its equivalent certificate.\n\n3. Intermediate or its equivalent certificate.\n\n3. Intermediate or its equivalent.\n4. Academic qualification certificates (Degree Or Post-Graduation).\n\n4. Academic qualification certificates (Degree / PG)\n5. Professional qualification certificates (D.Ed./Spl.D.Ed/ B.Ed/Spl.B.Ed / UGDPE /\nB.P.Ed., etc.).\n\n6. TET/CTET Original Score Card/Marks memo\n\n6. TET/CTET Original Score Card/Marks memo\n7. Study Certificates from Class IV to X (seven years) must be submitted, Or\nResidence certificate for 07 years prior to appearing in SSC, if appeared for S.S.C as\na Private Candidate. Candidates who migrated from Tolugana to Andhra P...\nRed Headmester\nAnthakpet\nist Sidr\n\nfrom\nBaldev\n\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - 