      "text_original": "between 2nd June, 2014 and 1st June, 2024 as per G.O. Ms. No. 161, General\nAdministration (SPF&MC) Department, dated:27:12.2022 and as per terms laid\ndown in Circular Memo No.4136/SPF & MC/2015-5, Dated.20.11.2017 and Circular\nMemo No.4136/SPF & MC/2015-17, Dated.27.12.2022 of Government of Andhra\nPradesh shall obtain the Local Status Certificate from competent authority and produce\nat the time of verification\n\n1. at the time of verification.\n2. The rule of reservation to local candidates is applicable as per the provisions of Andhra\n3. Pradesh Public Employment (OLC & RDR) Order (Presidential Order)1975, and\n4. amendments thereon shall be followed strictly.\n5. Integrated Community Certificate issued by the Tashildhar (for candidates who have\n6. claimed reservation under BC-A,B,C,D & E/SC(Group-I, II & III)/ST categories).\n7. EWS Certificate issued by the Tashildhar who claimed reservation under EWS\n8. Reservation.\n9. PH Certificate issued by the Referral Hospital (if applicable).\n10. RCI registration Certificate (if applicable).\n11. Service Certificate issued by Competent Authorities of the Department of Defense;\n12. GOI if applied under Ex-servicemen Quota.\n13. Experience Certificate (for the post of Principal, if applicable) as per the norms issued\n14. in the notification\n\n## Important Information and Instructions:\n\n1. Horizontal reservations (for Women, PBD, Meritorious Sports Persons, Ex-\n2. Servicemen) will be implemented as per rules in force and relevant Government\n3. Orders.\n4. The purpose of this letter is solely to verify the particulars furnished in the online\n5. application, which is a pre-requisite for consideration of candidature: Selection will be\n6. subject to fulfillment of all prescribed conditions.\n7. Candidates must produce all requisite original certificates on the date at the time of\n8. verification without fail. Failure to attend or produce certificates will result in\n9. cancellation of candidature for selection.\n10. Candidates must upload the certificates in his/her MEGA DSC-2025 login before\n11. attending the certificate verification venue.\n12. Candidates must bring all original certificates/documents which are uploaded in the\n13. online application along with three sets of xerox copies of the certificates/documents\n14. duly attested by a Gazetted Officer.\n15. Candidates should bring five recent passport-size photographs identical to the one\n16. uploaded in the online application.\n\nNote: The mere call letter is only for certificate verification and does not confer\nany right of selection,\n\nOPINIONS\nConvenor, MEGA DSC-2025\n\n2",
